00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.070 align:start position:0%
 
[Music]  famed food critic chef author and TV  personality Anthony Bourdain has died of  an apparent suicide at the age of 61  Bourdain was in France working on his  CNN series parts unknown when he was  found by his close friend and french  chef eric repair in his hotel room on  Friday morning  CNN confirmed the news in a statement  writing his love of great adventure new  friends find food and drink and the  remarkable stories of the world made him  a unique storyteller his talents never  cease to amaze us and we will miss him  very much  shortly after the tragic news broke  stars took to social media to express  their grief Chrissy Teigen tweeted quote  Anthony one of my idols unapologetic  passionate and one of the best  storytellers on the planet thank you for  making food so exciting and always  standing up for everything right  horrible  why why why be at peace now while Gordon  Ramsay wrote stunned and saddened by the  loss of Anthony Bourdain he brought the  world into our homes and inspired so  many people to explore cultures and  cities through their food Bourdain is  survived by his 11 year old daughter and  his girlfriend Asia Argento  [Music]

